[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466680890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99011#issuecomment-2466680890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99011","id":2466680890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TBpA6","user":{"login":"Lippanon","id":115422160,"node_id":"U_kgDOBuEz0A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115422160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon","html_url":"https://github.com/Lippanon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-10T10:39:10Z","updated_at":"2024-11-10T10:39:10Z","body":"I had a look. Your material is selected to use \"Per-Vertex\" shading, however this was only implemented recently in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/83360.\r\nIf you mouseover that property it says \"Not implemented yet\" (it is now implemented but that note will get removed soon in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97917/). I didn't check the dates but I suspect in dev2 it would fallback to the \"Per-Pixel\" mode, and in dev4 it actually does something so you see this different behaviour.\r\n\r\nSimply change the material's shading mode to default to get your \"old dev\" behaviour, which is per-pixel shading:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f4b4779-a8e2-46be-8eb7-d68e4e4dda08)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466680890/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480919649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99011#issuecomment-2480919649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99011","id":2480919649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T39Rh","user":{"login":"AlexanderParker","id":1546863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDY4NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1546863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexanderParker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexanderParker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-17T04:19:40Z","updated_at":"2024-11-17T04:20:56Z","body":"@Lippanon thank you for taking a look. I was unaware per-vertex shading wasn't implemented before (I guess I never checked the mouseover text), but that timeline with the versions makes sense. Changing to per-pixel fixed my problem, thanks.\r\n\r\nI'm wondering if this happens to others whether it might be worth adding a message shown when loading a project that was made before vertex shaders were implemented (if any shaders are detected using the per-vertex setting) as I'd notice an error in the message window more.\r\n\r\nAnyway thanks again for the quick fix, I probably would not have worked this out for a long time so you're a life saver :)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480919649/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]